# Never upload local secrets or local-only files to the host.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
/evals/.local/
# Not part of the app
.next/
node_modules/
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
*.log

# NOTE: these directory names are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. Without it, `evals/` also matched src/lib/evals/ and the build failed (2026-10-03).
# Added 2026-10-02 beyond the proposal (docs/proposals/deploy-env-audit-and-vercelignore.md), for two reasons.
# 1) The Arm B deployment file list showed the CLI uploaded .env and evals/.local although .gitignore lists them, so everything .gitignore hides is listed here too.
# 2) Documentation, drafts and raw experiment outputs are not part of the app and must not be uploaded.
/docs/
# .mailmap holds an email address; evals/ holds raw experiment outputs (including a cost ledger). Neither is used by the app or its build.
.mailmap
/evals/
dist/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
